---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE_NAME } from "../config";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Who is behind Predikt, and why you can trust our prediction-market guides."
  path="/about"
>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About {SITE_NAME}</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      {SITE_NAME} exists to make prediction markets understandable for normal
      people — without the jargon, hype, or pressure.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>
      We write clear, honest guides explaining what prediction markets are, how
      they work, and how the main platforms differ. When a guide helps you choose a
      platform and you sign up through our link, we may earn a commission. That's
      how the site is funded — and we tell you every time.
    </p>

    <h2>How we keep it honest</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We label affiliate links clearly and explain <a href="/how-we-make-money">how we make money</a>.</li>
      <li>We tell you when a platform <em>isn't</em> available to you, even if that means no commission.</li>
      <li>We don't promise winnings. Trading involves risk, and we say so.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, or feedback? Email
      <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.
      <span style="color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.9rem;">(Replace with your real address.)</span>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
